				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["	This is to certify that "+$F{Name-name}+", "+$F{Age-age}+" years old "+$V{VarSex}+" of "+$F{Street-street}+", "+$F{Street2-street2}+", "+$F{City-city}+", is seen and examined thru online consultation this day "+new SimpleDateFormat("MMMMM dd, yyyy").format($F{Start-session_start})+", "+"and is diagnosed to have "+"<b>"+$F{Context-context}+"</b>"
